---
// CursoColegiado.astro - Sub-view 3: Colegiado do Curso & Secretaria
---

<div class="space-y-4 text-[#0A0A0A]">
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-4 space-y-3">
    <div class="border-b border-[#DFDBD2] pb-2.5 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-door-open-fill text-[#8B1E2D] text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3 class="font-['Oswald'] text-base font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
            Secretaria do Colegiado de Gestão Pública
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Atendimento presencial e suporte acadêmico aos discentes:</p>
      </div>
      <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-red font-mono">
        Sala F-2039 FAFICH
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
      <div class="cagp-card p-3.5 bg-white space-y-1.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill text-[#8B1E2D] text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-xs text-[#8B1E2D]">Localização & Horário</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700"><strong>Sala:</strong> FAFICH, 2º Andar, Sala F-2039</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700"><strong>Atendimento:</strong> Norma Guedes</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700"><strong>Horário:</strong> Segunda a sexta, das 08h às 20h</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card p-3.5 bg-white space-y-1.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          <i class="bi bi-envelope-at-fill text-[#0A0A0A] text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-xs text-[#0A0A0A]">Canais Digitais</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700"><strong>E-mail:</strong> <span class="font-mono text-[#8B1E2D] font-bold">coordgestaopublica@gmail.com</span></p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Envio de requerimentos, certidões e dúvidas sobre matrícula presencial.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cagp-card p-3.5 bg-[#F7F5F0] text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-[#15803D] text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-xs text-[#0A0A0A]">Competências Regimentais do Colegiado</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        O Colegiado é a autoridade pedagógica máxima do curso, responsável por julgar processos de aproveitamento de disciplinas, dispensas de estágio (Art. 41), requerimentos de regime especial e homologação de bancas de TCC.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Atos Mestres: Leitura Direta no Super App -->
    <div class="pt-2 border-t border-[#DFDBD2]">
      <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-xs text-[#0A0A0A] block mb-2">
        Documentos Normativos Mestres do Curso:
      </span>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
        <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border border-[#DFDBD2]">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-red text-[10px] font-mono">PPC 2020</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold text-xs uppercase text-[#0A0A0A] block truncate mt-0.5">
              Projeto Pedagógico do Curso
            </span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 truncate">Estrutura de 3.000h e percursos</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/documentos/ppc-gestao-publica-ufmg"
            class="cagp-btn-primary text-xs py-1.5 px-2.5 whitespace-nowrap no-underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"
          >
            <i class="bi bi-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ler
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border border-[#DFDBD2]">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-dark text-[10px] font-mono">N-20229</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold text-xs uppercase text-[#0A0A0A] block truncate mt-0.5">
              Regulamento do Curso
            </span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 truncate">Normas de AAC, Estágio e TCC</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/documentos/regulamento-gestao-publica-ufmg"
            class="cagp-btn-primary text-xs py-1.5 px-2.5 whitespace-nowrap no-underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"
          >
            <i class="bi bi-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ler
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>